      "id": "insight-governed-data-gravity",
      "title": "Governed data gravity is the retention mechanism",
      "summary": "Enterprise retention is created when catalog, policy, lineage, quality, warehouse, lakehouse, and AI evaluation workflows become embedded in production operations. Data gravity matters most when it is usable, trusted, and connected to release and cost controls.",
      "implication": "Invest in catalog, policy, quality, and transformation surfaces as adoption infrastructure, not only compliance overhead.",
      "priority": "high",
      "tags": [
