      "id": "insight-ai-prod-bottleneck-is-control",
      "title": "The production AI bottleneck is control, not experimentation",
      "summary": "AI builders can reach prototypes quickly, but production adoption stalls when model access, data permissions, evaluation evidence, safety checks, and rollback paths are handled as separate approval queues.",
      "implication": "Model registry, prompt evaluation, safety controls, and serving telemetry should operate as one release system with automated evidence capture.",
      "priority": "high",
      "tags": [
